<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styler.css">
</head>
<body class="centered-bg">
    <h1>JokeHub</h1>
    <div class="start">
        <h2>Welcome to JokeHub, your go-to place for the bestest-est jokes in town! (more like my localnetwork)</h2>
        <button id="newJokeBtn">Get a New Joke</button>
    </div>


    <div id="jokeContainer" style="width: fit-content;">

        <h2 style="align-self: center;">DaD Jokes:</h2>

        <ul id="jokes"></ul>

    </div>

    <div class="chuck-norris-jokes">
        <button class="chuckNorrisBtn">Get a Chuck Norris Joke</button>

        <div id="jokeContainer">
            <h2>Chuck Joke(s):</h2>
            <ul id="chuckNorrisJoke"></ul>
        </div>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/axios/dist/axios.min.js"></script>
<script src="/scripts/app.js"></script>
</body>

<div class="end">
        <p>Thanks for visiting JokeHub! Hope you had a laugh or two. Come back soon for more jokes and fun!</p>
</div>
